# sheet by id (to): they arrive there with their grades, terms, contact, aliases and claims (renumbered
# on the other sheet) and leave this one entirely (see TransferPerson); someone there with their name or
# an alias has them merged into them. Anyone else, a retired person, this sheet's own id, names matching
# more than one person there or a retired one, or (when not merged) a contact already there, is refused.
# A viewer may change nothing: refused before anything is read or written.
guard:
  class: net.officefloor.hq.app.setting.RefuseViewer
  next: validate
